    "manufacturerDetails": "Materials & Technology \nHexagrid An ultralight, high strength nylon grid, laminated with TPU to create a minimalist yet structured material. PFAs and PFC-free.\nHDPE High strength and rigidity reinforcement boarding with good shape recall to avoid deformation.\nAero Optimised Active improvement of the aerodynamic performance of the bike and rider.\nUltralight Minimal design & lightweight materials for optimal weight-performance.\nProduct Information \nWeight \n– Top tube module – 120g\nTotal System Weight (incl. Frame Module) \n– Aero System (Medium) – 325g\n– Aero System (Large) – 355g\nCapacity \n– Top tube module – 0.8L\nStorage Configuration \n– Single main compartment\nClosure System \n– Full length waterproof zipper\nAttachment System \n– Two M5 hex-headed bolts anchor module to top tube mounts\n– Centre channel in base flexes around mounting points, pulling module flush against top tube for a gap-free fit\n– Elastic tensioner contours to the stem and draws Transfer Panels inwards for gap-free, aerodynamic efficiency\nReinforced Structure \n– Full-length carbon fibre reinforcement ensures a rigid, strap-free fit to the top tube\n– Internal HDPE thermoplastic frame\nWaterproofing \n– Seam Welded: bespoke materials and RF welding create watertight seams\nVisibility \n– Reflective graphics\nTesting Data \nWind Tunnel Tested Read the full Aero System White Paper here .\nCare & Maintenance \nLubricate zippers Clean & lubricate zippers regularly with silicone or petroleum-based grease to maintain performance.\nHandwash Only Handwash using dish soap & non-abrasive sponge. Dry flat. Do not machine wash or dry.",
