    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-08-30",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Description \nA lightweight frame bag for children. \nThe Apidura + Bombtrack Frame Pack is a versatile piece of kit that could easily stay on your child’s bike full time, carrying bikepacking kit and toys or providing a convenient space to store trail finds.\nThe bombtrack frame bag is designed for children’s bike frame geometries and constructed from a lightweight, all-weather laminate that’s tough enough to avoid the tears and scuffs of off-road riding. It’s also suited for storing heavier items, lowering the bike’s centre of gravity and allowing for more natural handling.\nInside, the bag is divided into two compartments. The larger compartment has plenty of space for bulkier items such as clothing or a packed lunch. In contrast, the smaller pocket is useful for flat items such as journals. We’ve also installed a battery lead and hose port for charging electronic devices or drinking on the go.\nWhile the body fabric of this bag is waterproof, due to the stitching process used to assemble the product, there is the possibility for water to enter through the seams when exposed to sustained rain. We recommend using an internal dry bag for contents that must remain absolutely dry. \nTechnical \nMaterials \nThe bombtrack frame bag is made from Dimension-Polyant VX21, a four-layer laminated fabric originally developed for the maritime industry. Designed to fit the demands of off-road riding, the material combines waterproofing, light weight, low stretch, and high abrasion and tear resistance.\nThe velcro straps are reinforced with Hypalon, a durable rubberised nylon that provides extra protection against friction and puncture in areas of high stress. For the fastening system, Woojin buckles are used for their reliability.\nCare \nWash the bombtrack frame bag by hand, using a mild diluted soap if necessary. Afterwards, let it air dry.\nDo not machine wash, machine dry, or iron.\nSize info \nApidura + Bombtrack Frame Pack FEATURES\nCable/Hydration Port Compatible with hydration bladders and charging devices on the go\nYour browser does not support the video tag. \nReflective Graphics High-contrast reflective design to enhance visibility in all light conditions\nCarbon-friendly attachment Carbon-friendly attachment with Hypalon-reinforced velcro straps\nDurable fabric Hard-wearing, all-weather Dimension Polyant VX21\nSizing \nSpecifications \nweight: 135 g\nWidth: 6 cm 2.4 in \nDownload printable template\nPrintable template Select your paper size\nA4\nUS Letter\nDownload pdf Download pdf \nINTERACTIVE SIZING TOOL \nFrame pack size should be selected based on the dimensions of your frame, not desired carrying capacity. Use our Interactive Sizing Tool to place packs on your bike and find the perfect fit.\nLaunch Sizing Tool \nCan't find your bike? \nManufacturer * Model * Bike Size * \nAdditional comment (max 1500 char.) Your Email * \nPlease leave this field empty. \nPrintable template Select your paper size\nA4\nUS Letter\nDownload pdf Download pdf",
    "description": {
      "en": "The Bombtrack Frame is a lightweight designed for children’s frame to carrying bikepacking kit and toys or providing a convenient space to store",
      "ru": "Нарамная сумка Apidura объёмом 2.4 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
