    "manufacturerDetails": "Description \nA durable lightweight frame bag for weekenders, overnighters, and everyday riding, reimagined to perfectly complement the Canyon Grizl. \nThe Apidura x Canyon Frame Pack utilises the area inside the Grizl’s main triangle, creating a lower centre of gravity and maintaining neutral handling and is perfect for everything from the pre-work spin to a multi-day gravel race. Like the Grizl, the pack is lightweight and rugged enough to tackle any terrain, featuring complementary elements of both the Racing and Backcountry Series frame bags.\nConstructed from an ultralight, waterproof laminate developed for Apidura and reinforced with an abrasion resistant panel, the frame bag is perfect for storing heavier, bulkier items, as well as items that need to be accessed on the go.\nAn integrated support structure adds stiffness and allows the frame bag to be exceptionally minimal and lightweight, two pockets and an anti-rattle pocket and internal lash tab hold contents securely in place. For added convenience, a protected cable port enables charging of devices on the go.\nTechnical \nPrecision Crafted using seam welding for unbeatable waterproofing. The frame bag mixes Racing Series design features and construction techniques for a lightweight minimal design, alongside Backcountry Series features for enhanced durability.\nSizing \nThe 2.4L Apidura x Canyon Frame Pack is designed to perfectly fit Grizls in any size. The 4.5L Apidura x Canyon Frame Pack is designed to perfectly fit Grizls in size L-2XL.\nMaterials \nHexalon to keep weight low and ensure the pack is waterproof\nHypalon reinforced straps and attachment points to enhance durability\n420D nylon abrasion panel to protect against wear in the toughest conditions\nFully waterproof, easy to use zip, designed to shed mud\nCare \nWash by hand, using a mild diluted soap if necessary. Afterwards, let it air dry. Do not machine wash, machine dry, or iron.\nSize info",
    "description": {
      "en": "The Apidura x Canyon Frame Bag is a lightweight & waterproof bag for weekenders & everyday riding, reimagined to perfectly complement the Canyon Grizlt",
      "ru": "Нарамная сумка Apidura объёмом 2.4 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
