    "sourceUrl": "https://www.apidura.com/shop/apidura-x-canyon-saddle-pack/",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-08-30",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Description \nThe quintessential bikepacking bag, reimagined to perfectly complement the Canyon Grizl. \nThe Apidura x Canyon Saddle Pack is ready-for-adventure and performance-oriented, drawing upon a complementary mix of Racing and Backcountry Series features. Much like the Grizl, the pack is designed to be lightweight and rugged enough to tackle anything from the hour-long spin before work to a 200-mile gravel race.\nConstructed from an ultralight, waterproof laminate developed for Apidura and reinforced with an abrasion resistant panel, the seat bag is designed to fit ergonomically under the saddle, minimising sway and reducing drag. A roll-top closure provides adjustable capacity, and tailored webbing, straps and buckles shed extra weight, while ensuring the simplest setup for ease of use when every second matters.\nTechnical \nPrecision Crafted using seam welding for unbeatable waterproofing. The saddle bag mixes Racing Series design features and construction techniques for a lightweight minimal design, alongside Backcountry Series features for enhanced durability.\nMaterials \nHexalon to keep weight low and ensure the pack is waterproof\nHypalon reinforced straps and attachment points to enhance durability\n420D nylon abrasion panel to protect against wear in the toughest conditions\nCare \nWash by hand, using a mild diluted soap if necessary. Afterwards, let it air dry. Do not machine wash, machine dry, or iron.\nSize info",
    "description": {
      "en": "The Apidura x Canyon Saddle bag is an ultralight & waterproof bag designed to tackle anything from the hour-long spin to a gravel race",
      "ru": "Подседельная сумка Apidura объёмом 5 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
