    "manufacturerDetails": "Materials & Technology \nHexalon Lightweight, waterproof & weldable trilaminate of TPU, Nylon & PU developed for Apidura. PFAs and PFC-free.\nDurable Built to last, using bespoke fabrics and tested designs to endure the harshest conditions.\nProduct Information \nWeight \n– 0.8L: 55g\n– 1.2L: 60g\n– 1.2L Plus: 80g\nStorage Configuration \n– Main compartment\n– External mesh pockets (‘Plus’ version only)\nClosure System \n– Drawcord\nAttachment System \n– 2 Hypalon reinforced velcro straps attach to handlebar\n– 1 nylon strap with quick release buckle attaches to fork\nWaterproofing \n– Seam Welded: bespoke materials and RF welding create watertight seams\n– There is the possibility for water to enter through the seams of stitched section when exposed to sustained rain. We recommend using an internal dry bag for contents that must remain absolutely dry\nSize info \nCare & Maintenance \nSpot clean only Stains can be spot treated with concentrated dishwashing liquid. Abrasion is not recommended",
