    "manufacturerDetails": "Materials & Technology \nExpedition Grade Fabric Waterproof, weldable & durable 3L fabric with cross-woven core. PFA & PFC-free.\nWelded Waterproof RF welded seams & bespoke fabrics for a 100% waterproof and ultra durable construction.\nDurable Built to last, using bespoke fabrics and tested designs to endure the harshest conditions.\nZipper Control Rails Reinforcement rails support zipper tension, for durable and reliably smooth, single-handed operation.\nFrame Fit Technology Adaptive Frame Fit Panels allow the pack to conform to the shape of the bikes tubing for a customised fit.\nProduct Information \nWeight \n– 2.8L: 210g\n– 3.8L: 244g\n– 4.3L: 263g\n– 5.7L: 282g\nStorage Configuration \n– Main compartment\n– Anti-rattle pocket on non-drive side\n– Internal mesh pocket\n– Internal gear attachment point\nClosure System \n– Waterproof zippers reinforced with internal fibre glass rails\nAttachment System \n– Three Hypalon Stability Straps attach to top tube\n– One Hypalon Stability Strap attaches to downtube\n– Frame-fit Panels conform to frame shape\n– Silicone print on straps and pack edges help maintain stability\nReinforced Structure \n– HDPE integrated structure\nWaterproofing \n– Seam Welded – bespoke materials and RF welding create watertight seams\nVisibility \n– Reflective graphics\nCare & Maintenance \nLubricate zippers Clean & lubricate zippers regularly with silicone or petroleum-based grease to maintain performance.\nHandwash Only Handwash using dish soap & non-abrasive sponge. Dry flat. Do not machine wash or dry.",
