    "manufacturerDetails": "Materials & Technology \nExpedition Grade Fabric Waterproof, weldable & durable 3L fabric with cross-woven core. PFA & PFC-free.\nUltrastretch Mesh Lightweight & durable. Tear-resistant 4-way stretch mesh designed for performance & longevity. PFAs and PFC-free.\nWelded Waterproof RF welded seams & bespoke fabrics for a 100% waterproof and ultra durable construction.\nDurable Built to last, using bespoke fabrics and tested designs to endure the harshest conditions.\nProduct Information \nWeight \n– 9L: 379g\n– 13L: 439g\n– 16L: 462g\nStorage Configuration \n– Main compartment\n– Two cargo mesh side pockets\n– Hypalon Compression Cradle and lash tab overflow\nClosure System \n– Roll-top and quick release buckle\n– Hypalon Compression Cradle with quick release buckle\n– SoftVent Air Valve\nAttachment System \n– One Hypalon Stability Strap attaches to seatpost\n– Two Hypalon buckled straps attach to saddle rails\n– Stability Channel with silicone print conforms to seatpost\nReinforced Structure \n– HDPE integrated structure\nWaterproofing \n– Seam Welded – bespoke materials and RF welding create watertight seams\nVisibility \n– Reflective graphics\nIntegrations \n– Integrated 3 prong light mount\nCare & Maintenance \nHandwash Only Handwash using dish soap & non-abrasive sponge. Dry flat. Do not machine wash or dry.",
