    "manufacturerDetails": "Materials & Technology \nHexalon Lightweight, waterproof & weldable trilaminate of TPU, Nylon & PU developed for Apidura. PFAs and PFC-free.\nHDPE High strength and rigidity reinforcement boarding with good shape recall to avoid deformation.\nUltralight Minimal design & lightweight materials for optimal weight-performance.\nWelded Waterproof RF welded seams & bespoke fabrics for a 100% waterproof and ultra durable construction.\nProduct Information \nWeight \n– 90g\nStorage Configuration \n– Main compartment\n– Internal lash tab\nClosure System \n– Waterproof zippers\nAttachment System \n– 2 Hypalon reinforced velcro straps attach to top tube\n– 1 nylon strap attaches to downtube\nReinforced Structure \n– HDPE integrated structure\nWaterproofing \n– Seam Welded – bespoke materials and RF welding create watertight seams\nVisibility \n– Reflective graphics\nSize info \nCare & Maintenance \nLubricate zippers Clean & lubricate zippers regularly with silicone or petroleum-based grease to maintain performance.\nSpot clean only Stains can be spot treated with concentrated dishwashing liquid. Abrasion is not recommended",
