    "manufacturerDetails": "Specifications \nDownload Print at Home Sizing Sheet (US Letter) \nDownload Print at Home Sizing Sheet (A4) \nLong Top Tube Bag – 1.6L\nSize\n1.6L \nWeight\n229g – Direct mount + 1 strap\n241g – Strap mount\nConstruction\n210D Hypalon & 210D Diamond RipStop \nAlso Included\n3 x 18.5cm Cargo Straps \n1 x 40cm Cargo Strap \n2 x T25 Torx Mounting Screws + Washers \nLong Top Tube Bag – 2.2L\nSize\n2.2L \nWeight\n273g – Direct mount + 1 strap\n281g – Strap mount\nConstruction\n210D Hypalon & 210D Diamond RipStop \nAlso Included\n3 x 18.5cm Cargo Straps \n1 x 40cm Cargo Strap \n2 x T25 Torx Mounting Screws + Washers \nLong Top Tube Bag – 3.0L\nSize\n3.0L \nWeight\n288g – Direct mount + 1 strap\n300g – Strap mount\nConstruction\n210D Hypalon & 210D Diamond RipStop \nAlso Included\n3 x 18.5cm Cargo Straps \n1 x 40cm Cargo Strap \n2 x T25 Torx Mounting Screws + Washers \n<div class=\"accordion-item\"",
    "description": {
      "en": "Extended storage for your top tube, the perfect place to easily access your kit. Specially sculpted 3D welded shapes eliminate knee rub. Patented V-Mounts secure the pack to your frame without risk of damage and remove the need for a front stabilising strap. All Long Top Tube Bags can be fitted with straps or as a bolt-on attachment (all hardware supplied). Additional accessory pack available separately.",
      "ru": "Сумка на верхнюю трубу Tailfin объёмом 1.6 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
