    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-01",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Whether you're out for an hour, commuting, or on a multi-day tour, the Restrap Bolt-on Top Tube Bag is perfectly designed to keep your tools and snacks within reach. Made from 100% waterproof textured nylon and with a tough YKK zip, it will withstand whatever your ride throws at it. READ MORE The headset fitting is designed to work with all headsets, including bikes with a low stack height. Whilst the sturdy plastic base has reinforced holes to allow it to fix onto the top tube bolt bosses, eliminating the need for straps and keeping the bag secure.\nMade in the UK with a lifetime warranty, all bags are finished with the classic Restrap label made from vegan-friendly PU.\nWeight - 95g\nCapacity - 0.8L",
