    "sourceUrl": "https://restrap.com/products/custom-frame-bag",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-01",
    "manufacturerDetails": "The lead time on custom frame bags is currently 28 working days from order. \nOur frame bag made to your design, to fit your frame.\nOur Custom Frame Bag is made with one large compartment (right side/drive side) with an internal velcro divider (optional) and a longer slender document pocket. With YKK zips, textured nylon outer and TPX fabrics, our frame bags are tough, durable and versatile. Included is a slot for camelback/dynamo positioned on the top of the bag.\nThe bags are finished with our classic label (PU leather/vegan-friendly), with the exception of TPX bags which are finished with a reflective heat pressed logo. \nPLEASE DO NOT ORDER THIS PRODUCT BEFORE COMPLETING YOUR DESIGN KIT . PLEASE NOTE THAT ONCE YOUR ORDER IS PLACED, WE CANNOT AMEND YOUR TEMPLATE. TO AMEND YOUR DESIGN YOU WILL NEED TO CANCEL & RE-ORDER. PLEASE CONTACT SUPPORT@RESTRAP.COM IF YOU NEED ANY ASSISTANCE.",
