    "manufacturerDetails": "The five-litre fork bag from Restrap offers yet more options for carrying your gear. Its 100% waterproof, roll-top design will keep your stuff dry no matter the spray and mud. READ MORE  Our Fork Bag works seamlessly with the Carry Cage and is compatible with most other fork cages. Its two 20mm straps and the option of four sturdy attachment loops keep it securely bound, whilst its hard-wearing Hypalon bases gives it stability and grip to the fork cage. \nHand made in our Yorkshire workshop, all bags are finished with the classic Restrap label, made from vegan-friendly PU. \nWeight - 187g \nCapacity- 5L \n(Cage not included)",
