    "sourceUrl": "https://restrap.com/products/holster-bar-bag",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-01",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Over ten years of experience and product development has led us to the latest iteration of our design classic. The perfect blend of evolution and revolution; the holster bar bag is the same product that you know, except better in every way. READ MORE\nWhy do we use a holster system? Because the most time consuming part of fitting and removing a bikepacking set up is strapping the bags to the bike. Our system allows you to leave the holster attached to the bike when you arrive at your destination and simply/quickly remove the dry bag in a couple of clicks. Easy. Reliable. Slick. Less faffing and more riding.\nEasy-fit attachment points make fitting the holster securely a doddle. Cam-locks on the handle bars and webbing fast straps around the fork crown combine speedy fitting with bombproof stability.\nOur unique GripTight patch secures the drybag to the holster. This has two benefits; firstly it makes placing the drybag in the holster an easier process, but most importantly it completely prevents the drybag slipping from side-to-side within the holster, no matter how rough the ride.\nThe drybag is manufactured from our most robust material ever. Designed to shrug off abrasions and perforations, it will keep the contents 100% waterproof, whatever the conditions. The double-ended design allows easy access to everything within.\nThe elastic Stowage Strap is perfect for quickly stashing a pair of gloves or windproof jacket and keeping them immediately to hand for when conditions change.\nQuickly clip a light to the built-in mount, for obstruction free placement\nThe Holster Bar Bag has been designed in conjunction with our Roll Top Canister Bag. Quickly and easily mount the Roll Top Canister Bag to boost capacity and add accessible, waterproof storage.\nWeight - 480g\nCapacity - 14L",
    "description": {
      "en": "Holster Bar Bag is a Restrap handlebar bag in 14 L. Technical data is normalized from the official product page.",
      "ru": "Рулевая сумка Restrap объёмом 14 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
