    "manufacturerDetails": "Holster Bar Bag + Rolltop Canister Bag = Holster Bar Bag Plus. Three modular options to suit your ride for even better value than buying separately.  \nIf you’re bikepacking light, leave the Rolltop Canister Bag at home and load up the Holster Bar Bag. Carrying a little more? Attaching the Rolltop Canister Bag to the front of the Holster Bar Bag takes a matter of seconds and you instantly have an easily accessible, fully waterproof additional four litres of capacity. READ MORE \nWhy do we use a holster system? Because the most time consuming part of fitting and removing a bikepacking set up is strapping the bags to the bike. Our system allows you to leave the holster attached to the bike when you arrive at your destination and simply/quickly remove the dry bag in a couple of clicks. Easy. Reliable. Slick. Less faffing and more riding. \nEasy-fit attachment points make fitting the holster securely a doddle. Cam-locks on the handle bars and webbing fast straps around the fork crown combine speedy fitting with bombproof stability. Our unique GripTight patch secures the drybag to the holster. This has two benefits; firstly it makes placing the drybag in the holster easier, but most importantly it completely prevents the drybag slipping from side-to-side within the holster, no matter how rough the ride. \nThe drybag is manufactured from robust material, keeping the contents 100% waterproof, whatever the conditions. The double-ended design allows easy access to everything within. \nThe elastic Stowage Strap on the holster is perfect for quickly stashing a pair of gloves or windproof jacket and keeping them immediately to hand for when conditions change. \nThe Holster Bar Bag Plus comes with our modular Rolltop Canister Bag. Use it solo on your handlebars or mount it to the Holster Bar Bag via our 3P attachment system to boost capacity. Quick to remove and wearable with a lightweight and adjustable paracord strap, it’s perfect on and off the bike. \nWeight - 755g \nCapacity - 18L (with Rolltop Canister Bag)",
    "description": {
      "en": "Holster Bar Bag Plus is a Restrap handlebar bag in 18 L. Technical data is normalized from the official product page.",
      "ru": "Рулевая сумка Restrap объёмом 18 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
