    "sourceUrl": "https://restrap.com/products/race-bar-bag-flat-bar",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-01",
    "manufacturerDetails": "First launched in 2020 our Race Range is developed for racers and anyone who wants to travel light and fast. Made from lightweight, but resilient materials, we haven’t compromised durability or functionality in the search for gram saving.\nThe Race Bar Bag - Flat Bar uses an updated holster system bar bag, taking all of our product development experience to create the most functional version yet. READ MORE\nWhy do we use a holster system? Because the most time consuming part of fitting and removing a bikepacking set up is strapping the bags to the bike. Our system allows you to leave the holster attached to the bike when you arrive at your destination and simply/quickly remove the dry bag in a couple of clicks. Reverse that process when you set off. Easy. Reliable. Slick. Less faffing and more riding. \nThe Race Holster is married to a double roll dry bag, specifically optimised for flat bars. With 7L of functional, 100% waterproof carrying capacity, it allows for greater clearance (with a compact 160mm diameter) above the front wheel by running wider than our drop-bar version. With openings at either end, it allows you to easily access the entire contents without having to empty out the whole bag.\nAs with all of our holster system bar bags, the Race Bar Bag - Flat Bar uses our innovative GripTight patch for additional stability. A hook and loop system firmly secures the dry bag within the holster meaning that placing a full drybag in the holster is an easier process and the drybag is completely prevented from slipping from side-to-side within the holster, no matter how rough the ride.\nThe Race Holster is compatible with both the Race Double-Roll Dry Bag (included) and Race Roll-Top Dry Bag.\nProduct Weight - 305g (Including Dry Bag)\nCapacity - 7L",
    "description": {
      "en": "Race Bar Bag - Flat Bar is a Restrap handlebar bag in 7 L. Technical data is normalized from the official product page.",
      "ru": "Рулевая сумка Restrap объёмом 7 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
