    "sourceUrl": "https://restrap.com/products/rolltop-canister-bag",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-01",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Flexibility is king when bikepacking. Most of us are minimalists, maximalists, weight weenies, “just-in-case-ies”, day riders, overnighters and long distance riders at different times during our riding lives and sometimes over the course of the same weekend.\nThat’s why we design all of our products to work as part of a larger system of luggage. Use them by themselves, or team them up when you need more capacity. Nothing summarises this design philosophy more than our Rolltop Canister Bag – master of all trades, jack of none… READ MORE\nThe Rolltop Canister Bag is a multifunctional item that is designed to fit directly onto your handlebars or mount onto the Holster Bar Bag via our 3P attachment system. When not on the bike, the Rolltop Canister Bag can be slung over the shoulder, making it the perfect accessory for storing your valuables or smash-and-grab garage forecourt snack raids. The 4l capacity makes it ideal for a selection of food, extra layers, point-and-shoot camera and wallet/passport.\nThe 100% waterproof Rolltop Canister Bag fits directly on to your bars via webbing fast straps and is secured around the headtube with a simple elastic toggle. A Fidlock buckle keeps the rolltop rolled and bag compressed, but is easy to open with a single hand. Stretchy mesh side pockets are perfect for stashing gels or snacks.\nWhen using the Rolltop Canister Bag with the Holster Bar Bag, the webbing fast straps simply thread through specific D-rings on the front of the Holster. An extra velcro strap secures the Rolltop Canister Bag at the bottom and prevents any bounce.\nRemoving the Rolltop Canister Bag takes seconds, wherever you mount it. Whip it off when you get to a cafe stop and sling it over your shoulder using the included minimalist and adjustable paracord strap – simply clip the other end to the dedicated tab. Drop your GPS device in one of the sidepockets and feel confident that your valuables are with you and away from wandering hands.\nWeight - 275g\nCapacity - 4L",
    "description": {
      "en": "Rolltop Canister Bag is a Restrap handlebar bag in 4 L. Technical data is normalized from the official product page.",
      "ru": "Рулевая сумка Restrap объёмом 4 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
