    "sourceUrl": "https://restrap.com/products/switch-pannier-10-litres-1",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-01",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Designed for adventure, convenient for the commute, our Restrap Switch Pannier is the perfect partner for those who like to carry more, or simply prefer a pannier system to bikepacking bags. They are also ideal for smaller bikes with less clearance for saddle and bar bags. Simply attach to your fork bosses or any compatible rack. READ MORE\nThe Restrap Switch Pannier combines durable, waterproof external fabrics to create an extremely hardwearing, easy to clean outer. Paired with a fully seam-sealed inner, you can be confident that the contents will stay dry; whether it’s your sleeping bag or work shirt. \nIncluded: 10 Litre Pannier Bag and Switch Multi-Mount bracket\nClick and go\nThe Restrap Switch Pannier uses an injection moulded clip that drops directly into the Hiplok x Restrap Switch mount and a flexible back plate that provides structure to the pannier, while also dampening vibration and minimising rattles over rough ground.\nThe Hiplok x Restrap Switch system is a quick, simple and secure, modular fitment that can be used anywhere that has bottle bosses. It is ideal for many modern gravel forks and compatible rear racks. The Hiplok x Restrap Switch system not only allows you to place and remove your panniers in a matter of seconds, it also allows you to switch between panniers and the Hiplok Switch Lock. You can also quickly switch between carry and bottle cages with the Switch Multimount. Flip between load lugging, quick commuting and extra hydration from one day to the next. \nFitting \nHiplok x Restrap Switch system can be fitted to any bottle bosses. \nPlease use the bolts provided. We recommend tightening the bolts to 5Nm, but please check your fork manufacturer’s specification. \nWe recommend not exceeding 3kg weight including the bag itself. This is because most bottle boss mounts are only rated to 1.5kg per bolt.\nTo attach the Switch Pannier, simply slide the Switch clip into the Switch mount bracket.\nTo remove the Switch Pannier, press the base of the Switch clip towards the bag and gently lift upwards. \nPacking and use \nIt is easiest to fill the bag before attaching it to the bike\nEnsure three folds on the roll-top closure to guarantee full waterproofness\nProduct Weight - 520g (including fitting)\nCapacity - 10 Litres",
    "description": {
      "en": "Switch Pannier (10 Litres) is a Restrap front/rear pannier in 10 L. Technical data is normalized from the official product page.",
      "ru": "Универсальный панир Restrap объёмом 10 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
