    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-01",
    "manufacturerDetails": "The Tool Pouch is ideal for carrying tubes, tools and spares during all kinds of riding, from road rides to mountain biking. READ MORE  Made with hardwearing 1000D textured nylon outer, this pouch is tough against grit and grime. The foam cushioning helps protect your tools and an internal storage sleeve is perfect for smaller items.\nThe adjustable velcro flap ensures that the pouch fits well, whether it's packed to the brim or lightly loaded and includes reflective detailing to aid visibility during night-time riding. Finished with the classic Restrap label, made from vegan-friendly PU. \nWeight - 78g \nCapacity - 0.6L",
