    "sourceUrl": "https://revelatedesigns.com/product/burrote/",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-02",
    "manufacturerDetails": "The Burrote is a waterproof bag built for the top of rear racks. High-capacity stretch side pockets and top shock cord lacing keep food, layers, and wet gear easy to reach while separating them from the dry bag’s contents. A tapered profile provides added saddle clearance and makes the bag well-suited for bikes with dropper posts.\nA durable Hypalon reinforcement with a thin layer of foam protects the bag and contents from the rack. Integrated strap keepers help prevent mounting straps from sliding off the ends of the bag, and a rear compression strap keeps the load tight and secure. Replaceable shock cords keep the system working for the long haul.\nDimensions\n\nUS \nMetric \nMaximum packed length\n18 in\nHeight\n7 in\nWidth\n7 in\nMaximum packed length\n460 mm\nHeight\n178 mm\nWidth\n178 mm\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\n9.5 oz\n610 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\n268 g\n10 L\nMaterials: Fabric: 420d TPU laminated ripstop, C0 DWR, Hypalon reinforcements, 4-way stretch quick-dry mesh. Imported.\nReviews",
    "description": {
      "en": "The Burrote is a waterproof bag built for the top of rear racks. High-capacity stretch side pockets and top shock cord lacing keep food, layers, and wet gear easy to reach while separating them from the dry bag’s contents. A tapered profile provides added saddle clearance and makes the bag well-suited for bikes with dropper posts.\nA durable Hypalon reinforcement with a thin layer of foam protects the bag and contents from the rack. Integrated strap keepers help prevent mounting straps from sliding off the ends of the bag, and a rear compression strap keeps the load tight and secure. Replaceable shock cords keep the system working for the long haul.\nDimensions",
      "ru": "Сумка на багажник Revelate Designs объёмом 10 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
