    "manufacturerDetails": "The Campamocha is a sleek handlebar bag built for snacks, layers, and ride essentials. \nFor the avid gravel rider, the bag makes use of the space beneath the bars, and a two-way top zipper gives easy on-bike access. The flexible three-point mounting also makes it a great fit on flat bars as well. \nThe bag’s exterior is 100% recycled 200D EcoPak. Closed-cell foam adds structure, and the bright-colored polyester lining helps keep track of small items. The mounting system uses a pair of molded rubber blocks that connect to a fiberglass stiffener, giving a rock-solid connection while spacing the bag away from your handlebars. \nThe Campamocha balances compact convenience with Revelate’s signature durability, so you’re prepared wherever the trail takes you. \nDimensions\n\nOptimized for drop bars, but works great on flat bars as well.\nAlthough the Campamocha has a slim profile, please ensure that there is a minimum of 6 inches of clearance between your handlebar and front tire. If your bike has front suspension, make sure to measure with the suspension fully compressed, or calculate the measurement accordingly.\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\nOne Size\n8.5 oz\n140 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\nOne Size\n241 g\n2.3 L\nMaterials: 100% recycled 200D EcoPak, Hypalon reinforced mounting points, \nPFAS free compliant materials. \nImported\nReviews",
    "description": {
      "en": "The Campamocha is a sleek handlebar bag built for snacks, layers, and ride essentials. \nFor the avid gravel rider, the bag makes use of the space beneath the bars, and a two-way top zipper gives easy on-bike access. The flexible three-point mounting also makes it a great fit on flat bars as well. \nThe bag’s exterior is 100% recycled 200D EcoPak. Closed-cell foam adds structure, and the bright-colored polyester lining helps keep track of small items. The mounting system uses a pair of molded rubber blocks that connect to a fiberglass stiffener, giving a rock-solid connection while spacing the bag away from your handlebars. \nThe Campamocha balances compact convenience with Revelate’s signature durability, so you’re prepared wherever the trail takes you. \nDimensions",
      "ru": "Рулевая сумка Revelate Designs объёмом 2.3 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
