    "manufacturerDetails": "The Cranny is a micro frame bag for day ride essentials! This small but mighty bike bag was designed to fill underutilized space, especially on full suspension bikes. The Cranny is the smallest frame bag we’ve ever made and about half the capacity of its larger counterpart, the Nook . The panel opening design with a curved zipper provides access to the interior with small mesh organizer pockets and key clip. Silicone backed hook and loop straps lock to the frame and are easy on finishes. Whether you’re riding a mountain, road, fat, or gravel bike, the Cranny packs it in!\nCheck out the Review from Bikepacking.com \nDimensions\n\nUS \nMetric \nA\n9 in\nB\n6.5 in\nWidth\n3.75 in\nA\n229 mm\nB\n165 mm\nWidth\n95 mm\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\n2.5 oz\n38 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\n72 g\n0.6 L\nMaterials: Eco Pack EPX200 - 200 denier waterproof fully recycled laminate C0 DWR. Recycled Polyester lining fabrics.\nReviews",
