    "manufacturerDetails": "The Action Tote brings Kristin Vantrease’s linocut illustration of bikepacking in Denali to a durable 25L carry-all built for grocery runs, gear stashing, road trips, and daily use.\nMade from tough X-Pac fabric that holds its shape, the Action Tote is easy to load, quick to grab, and ready to toss in the back of the car on the way out the door. Bright colors make it effortless to spot wherever you put it, from the garage to the trailhead.\nSimple, sturdy, and made in the USA, it’s a utilitarian go-to bag that’s ready for action when you are.\nDimensions\n\nUS \nMetric \nLength\n14 in\nWidth\n8.5 in\nHeight\n13 in\nLength\n356 mm\nWidth\n216 mm\nHeight\n330 mm\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\nOne Size\n6.7 oz\n1525 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\nOne Size\n191 g\n25 L\nMaterials: X-Pac. Made in USA\nReviews",
