    "sourceUrl": "https://revelatedesigns.com/product/egress-pocket/",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-02",
    "manufacturerDetails": "The Egress™ Pocket is a versatile 3-in-1 waterproof, roll-top handlebar bag designed for adventure and practicality. It seamlessly integrates with roll-style handlebar bags, mounts directly to handlebars, and quickly converts into a minimalist hip pack for off-bike use.\nBuilt with distance travelers in mind, the Egress Pocket keeps valuables and electronics within easy reach. Its camera-bag-style padded liner includes a movable divider and a small zippered pocket, offering protection for electronics even when the bag is removed and set down at camp.\nThe Egress is equally at home on a multi-month trip in the mountains of Peru as it is on your daily gravel bike spin.\nDimensions\n\nUS \nMetric \nMax Height (H)\n8 in\nMin Height (H)\n7 in\nLength (L)\n9.5\nin\nWidth (W)\n3 in\nMax Height (H)\n203\nmm\nMin Height (H)\n178 mm\nLength (L)\n241 mm\nWidth (W)\n76 mm\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\n10 oz\n175 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\n284 g\n2.8 L\nMaterials: 420 denier TPU laminated Nylon Recycled polyester interior lining, closed cell foam TPU based Hypalon\nReviews",
    "description": {
      "en": "The Egress™ Pocket is a versatile 3-in-1 waterproof, roll-top handlebar bag designed for adventure and practicality. It seamlessly integrates with roll-style handlebar bags, mounts directly to handlebars, and quickly converts into a minimalist hip pack for off-bike use.\nBuilt with distance travelers in mind, the Egress Pocket keeps valuables and electronics within easy reach. Its camera-bag-style padded liner includes a movable divider and a small zippered pocket, offering protection for electronics even when the bag is removed and set down at camp.\nThe Egress is equally at home on a multi-month trip in the mountains of Peru as it is on your daily gravel bike spin.\nDimensions",
      "ru": "Рулевая сумка Revelate Designs объёмом 2.8 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
