    "manufacturerDetails": "The Gas Tank is a high end, high volume top tube bag for carrying a ton of food and other gear. It offers substantial storage in an easy access case.\nThe updated 3D welded top lid zips open on both sides for one-handed access while riding or open up both when stopped for full panel access to the contents.\nGreat for snacks, tools, navigation and whatever you want to have fast access too!\nDimensions\n\nUS \nMetric \nLength (L)\n9 in\nWidth (W)\n2.5 in\nHeight at Stem\n5 in\nRear Taper\n1.75 in\nLength (L)\n229 mm\nWidth (W)\n64 mm\nHeight at Stem\n127 mm\nRear Taper\n44.5 mm\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\n3.5 oz\n70 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\n99 g\n1.1 L\nMaterials: EPX 200d Recycled Polyester CFC free DWR exterior, Recycled Polyester interior lining fabrics, EVA foam padded tube sections; YKK RC zipper.\nReviews",
