    "sourceUrl": "https://revelatedesigns.com/product/hopper/",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-02",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Our first true universal fitting frame bag, the Hopper fits most adult sized bikes and many full suspension frame bikes with a vertically mounted shock.\nThis mid-frame fitting zipper-less bag was painstakingly developed to work well whether the bag is empty or full to the brim. Due to a short length that would make zipper access difficult, we combined design knowledge from the popular Mag-Tank cockpit with a decade of tried and true frame bag manufacturing. The result is a single-handed accessible, panel opening frame bag with an effortless magnetic closure.\nWe’re now offering the Hopper bag with a hydration bundle! The hydration system includes a 1.5 liter water reservoir, HydraPak Plug n’Play hose for easy refilling, and our Barnacle handlebar clips. The Hopper does not have a dedicated hydration tube port, but running a hose out behind the flap opening works great!\nDimensions\n\nThe Hopper’s unique design allows for the shape to be compressed or expanded over the profile of the bag to fit a wide array of bikes. To best determine fit, you may use the sizing charts below.\nSize templates:\nHopper Printable full size PDF pattern \nUS \nMetric \nTop tube length (A)\n11 in\nHead tube length (B)\n2 in\nDown tube length (C)\n12 in\nRear height (D)\n7 in\nTop tube length (A)\n280 mm\nHead tube length (B)\n50 mm\nDown tube length (C)\n305 mm\nRear height (D)\n180 mm\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\nHopper\n6 oz\n152.6 in³\nHopper Hydration Bundle\n11.2 oz\n152.6 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\nHopper\n170 g\n2.5 L\nHopper Hydration Bundle\n318 g\n2.5 L\nMaterials: Dimension Polyant VX-21 with abrasion resistant finish; 420-denier diamond ripstop lining; closed-cell foam.\nReviews",
    "description": {
      "en": "Our first true universal fitting frame bag, the Hopper fits most adult sized bikes and many full suspension frame bikes with a vertically mounted shock.\nThis mid-frame fitting zipper-less bag was painstakingly developed to work well whether the bag is empty or full to the brim. Due to a short length that would make zipper access difficult, we combined design knowledge from the popular Mag-Tank cockpit with a decade of tried and true frame bag manufacturing. The result is a single-handed accessible, panel opening frame bag with an effortless magnetic closure.\nWe’re now offering the Hopper bag with a hydration bundle! The hydration system includes a 1.5 liter water reservoir, HydraPak Plug n’Play hose for easy refilling, and our Barnacle handlebar clips. The Hopper does not have a dedicated hydration tube port, but running a hose out behind the flap opening works great!\nDimensions",
      "ru": "Нарамная сумка Revelate Designs объёмом 2.5 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
