    "sourceUrl": "https://revelatedesigns.com/product/joey-downtube-bag/",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-02",
    "manufacturerDetails": "The Joey is a fully welded, waterproof bag designed for bikes with limited frame space or extra storage needs. Mounted near the bottom bracket, it keeps hard-to-pack items low for better stability. A compression-molded foam panel and silicone-coated straps ensure a secure fit on rough terrain. The roll-top closure allows easy access and prevents zipper issues in muddy conditions.\n1L Joey: The compact 1L size fits bikes with limited tire clearance and narrower width cranks. It easily holds a 4 oz fuel canister, repair gear, or spare parts.\n2L Joey: The 2L Joey is a great place to stow items like canister stoves, small cooking pots, most 2L hydration bladders, or an 8 oz fuel canister with extra room.\nDimensions\n\nNOTE: It is mandatory to check tire clearance prior to use, especially with front suspension bikes. Always check for tire clearance with your suspension at full travel. \nUS \nMetric \n1L\n2L\nH\n4 in\n5 in\nW\n4 in\n5 in\nL\n7 in\n9 in\n1L\n2L\nH\n102 mm\n127 mm\nW\n102 mm\n127 mm\nL\n178 mm\n229 mm\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\n1L\n3.8 oz\n91.5 in³\n2L\n4.8 oz\n146.5 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\n1L\n109 g\n1.5 max L\n2L\n137 g\n2.4 max L\nMaterials: 420 denier TPU laminated nylon; exterior TPU coating; white interior; coated dual density foam panel; RF welded seams\nReviews",
    "description": {
      "en": "The Joey is a fully welded, waterproof bag designed for bikes with limited frame space or extra storage needs. Mounted near the bottom bracket, it keeps hard-to-pack items low for better stability. A compression-molded foam panel and silicone-coated straps ensure a secure fit on rough terrain. The roll-top closure allows easy access and prevents zipper issues in muddy conditions.\n1L Joey: The compact 1L size fits bikes with limited tire clearance and narrower width cranks. It easily holds a 4 oz fuel canister, repair gear, or spare parts.\n2L Joey: The 2L Joey is a great place to stow items like canister stoves, small cooking pots, most 2L hydration bladders, or an 8 oz fuel canister with extra room.\nDimensions",
      "ru": "Сумка на вилку или нижнюю трубу Revelate Designs объёмом 2 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
