    "manufacturerDetails": "Our Mag-Tank features a fitted lid with welded construction . The all-new molded rubber strap system connects to the mag tank’s stiffened internal structure for maximum stability.\nThe Fidlock magnetic buckle holds the lid tight and keeps contents secure when the route gets rowdy, and a removable TPU liner lets you easily clean your snack mess after your bender in the hills.\nDimensions\n\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\nOne Size\n6.6 oz\n30.5 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\nOne Size\n187 g\n0.5 L\nMaterials: 210 D TPU laminated Nylon ripstop, TPU film (liner), HDPE Plastic stiffener, Molded Silicone Rubber. Imported.\nReviews",
