    "manufacturerDetails": "The Ranger is a workhorse of a frame bag. Designed to make use of the full triangle, the Ranger fits a huge range of standard mountain and fatbike geometries. We used our wealth of knowledge from years of custom bike bag building to deliver on a bomber, feature rich bag, that you can swap to different frames for years to come.\nCompared to the Rifter, the Ranger fits more “old school” bike geometry and is the go-to for steel mountain bike frames.\nAs frame bags are intended to carry dense items like food and water, we emphasize durability and fast access in the design and features. Ranger bags can be loaded full and still accessed while riding. Something that is impossible with higher bulk, roll closure frame bags.\nNamed Best in Bikepacking in Bikepacking.com’s Gear of the Year Awards !\nDimensions\n\nThe Ranger comes in four sizes. Dimensions shown should be interpreted as a minimum fit size. As a rule of thumb – size down if on the fence. It is better to have a tensioned fit than a loose & sloppy fit! Online schematics of bike geometry typically do not detail the measurements necessary to determine fit. We recommend an old fashion ruler for this part.\nSize templates:\nPrintable Full Size PDF Pattern – All Sizes (SM-XL) \nUS \nMetric \nSM\nMD\nLG\nXL\nA\n16.25 in\n18.5 in\n20 in\n21.5 in\nB\n1.5 in\n1.75 in\n1.75 in\n2 in\nC\n16.25 in\n17.75 in\n18.5 in\n20.5 in\nD\n3.25 in\n4 in\n4 in\n4 in\nE\n8.25 in\n10.25 in\n11.5 in\n13.75 in\nSM\nMD\nLG\nXL\nA\n419 mm\n470 mm\n508 mm\n546 mm\nB\n38 mm\n44 mm\n44 mm\n51 mm\nC\n413 mm\n451 mm\n470 mm\n521 mm\nD\n83 mm\n102 mm\n102 mm\n102 mm\nE\n201 mm\n260 mm\n292 mm\n349 mm\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\nSM\n12 oz\n366 in³\nMD\n13 oz\n445 in³\nLG\n15 oz\n525 in³\nXL\n17 oz\n610 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\nSM\n340 g\n6 L\nMD\n369 g\n7.3 L\nLG\n425 g\n8.6 L\nXL\n482 g\n10 L\nMaterials: Dimension Polyant VX-21 with abrasion resistant finish; 1050 denier domestic ballistics nylon; 420 denier diamond ripstop lining; closed cell foam padded tube sections.\nReviews",
    "description": {
      "en": "The Ranger is a workhorse of a frame bag. Designed to make use of the full triangle, the Ranger fits a huge range of standard mountain and fatbike geometries. We used our wealth of knowledge from years of custom bike bag building to deliver on a bomber, feature rich bag, that you can swap to different frames for years to come.\nCompared to the Rifter, the Ranger fits more “old school” bike geometry and is the go-to for steel mountain bike frames.\nAs frame bags are intended to carry dense items like food and water, we emphasize durability and fast access in the design and features. Ranger bags can be loaded full and still accessed while riding. Something that is impossible with higher bulk, roll closure frame bags.\nNamed Best in Bikepacking in Bikepacking.com’s Gear of the Year Awards !\nDimensions",
      "ru": "Нарамная сумка Revelate Designs объёмом 7.3 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
