    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-02",
    "manufacturerDetails": "If miles upon miles of open dirt roads are your calling, the Ripio® frame bag will haul your stuff on your next bikepacking or bike touring trip. The Ripio is the full-frame solution for your road, gravel, or touring bike. With geometry optimized for frames with tall top tubes & head tubes, the Ripio fits a huge range of bikes and is packed with features that make use of the larger frame space road geometry provides.\nDimensions\n\nThe Ripio comes in four sizes. Dimensions shown should be interpreted as a minimum fit size. As a rule of thumb – size down if on the fence. Online schematics of bike geometry typically do not detail the measurements necessary to determine fit. We recommend an old fashion ruler for this part. Click here for a Printable Full Size PDF Pattern. \nUS \nMetric \nSM\nMD\nLG\nXL\nA\n17.50 in\n19.50 in\n20.50 in\n21.50 in\nB\n1.00 in\n1.25 in\n3 in\n4.75 in\nC\n17.50 in\n18.50 in\n19.00 in\n20.50 in\nD\n2.75 in\n4.25 in\n3.75 in\n3.25 in\nE\n13.5 in\n14.75 in\n17.00 in\n19.75 in\nSM\nMD\nLG\nXL\nA\n445 mm\n495 mm\n521 mm\n546 mm\nB\n25 mm\n32 mm\n76 mm\n121 mm\nC\n451 mm\n470 mm\n483 mm\n521 mm\nD\n70 mm\n108 mm\n95 mm\n83 mm\nE\n343 mm\n375 mm\n432 mm\n502 mm\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\nSM\n13 oz\n305 in³\nMD\n14 oz\n385 in³\nLG\n16 oz\n470 in³\nXL\n17.4 oz\n550 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\nSM\n364 g\n5 L\nMD\n397 g\n6.3 L\nLG\n454 g\n7.7 L\nXL\n493 g\n9 L\nMaterials: Dimension Polyant VX-21 with abrasion resistant finish; TPU laminated stretch woven Cordura; 1050 denier domestic ballistics nylon; 420 denier diamond ripstop lining with full perimeter foam padded tube sections.\nReviews",
