    "sourceUrl": "https://revelatedesigns.com/product/rohn-rack-bag/",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-02",
    "manufacturerDetails": "The Rohn Rack bag is a huge dry bag dialed for carrying winter-specific gear. We’ve put 20 years of Alaskan winter riding into the feature set of this bag. The Rohn will carry your warmest, bulkiest gear for the crisp days and long nights ahead.\nWe sized the Rohn to fit a -20 down sleeping bag, with an air pad, and a full set of puffy pants and a down parka. With its large opening, you can shove everything in without worrying much about compression. The Rohn will fit a -40 bag with less clothing (depending on the person’s size), but it’s big!\nBuilt with tear-resistant UHMWPE ripstop Challenge Ultra Grid fabric, the exterior features easy access to a foam pad or gear lashed to the top, and the high-volume side pockets allow quick access to hand warmers, face layers, and other winter essentials that you can never find the right place for.\nIncludes a set of rack-mounting girth hitch straps. These 4-point straps stay fixed to the rack rails and don’t dangle under the rack into the wheel when unclipped.\nDimensions\n\nDiameter: Approximately 11in (279mm)\nMax Length: 24in (610mm)\nLength measurement is with end rolled 3 times for waterproofing.\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\nOne Size\n11.2 oz\n2257 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\nOne Size\n320 g\nMax 37-39 L\nMaterials: Challenge Ultra Grid 200d, fully seam taped. Made in Alaska.\nReviews",
    "description": {
      "en": "The Rohn Rack bag is a huge dry bag dialed for carrying winter-specific gear. We’ve put 20 years of Alaskan winter riding into the feature set of this bag. The Rohn will carry your warmest, bulkiest gear for the crisp days and long nights ahead.\nWe sized the Rohn to fit a -20 down sleeping bag, with an air pad, and a full set of puffy pants and a down parka. With its large opening, you can shove everything in without worrying much about compression. The Rohn will fit a -40 bag with less clothing (depending on the person’s size), but it’s big!\nBuilt with tear-resistant UHMWPE ripstop Challenge Ultra Grid fabric, the exterior features easy access to a foam pad or gear lashed to the top, and the high-volume side pockets allow quick access to hand warmers, face layers, and other winter essentials that you can never find the right place for.\nIncludes a set of rack-mounting girth hitch straps. These 4-point straps stay fixed to the rack rails and don’t dangle under the rack into the wheel when unclipped.\nDimensions",
      "ru": "Сумка на багажник Revelate Designs объёмом 37 / 39 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
