    "sourceUrl": "https://revelatedesigns.com/product/sandur/",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-02",
    "manufacturerDetails": "This partial frame bag is ready for your next gravel adventure. With beefy zippers, stretch panels, a stiffened top panel, and full perimeter padding, the Sandur is durable, sturdy, and keeps its narrow profile to stay out of your way while pedaling. The slim left side pocket features organizer sleeves and a wire exit port. The main compartment is spacious with an extra mesh pocket for stashing small items. Our two sizes fit a wide range of gravel bikes.\nYou can purchase the Sandur either with or without our custom hydration system. The hydration system includes a custom Revelate X Hydrapak 1.5 liter water reservoir, Plug n’Play hose for easy refilling, and our Barnacle handlebar clips. \nDimensions\n\nUS \nMetric \nSM\nLG\nA\n14.5 in\n15 in\nB\n7.5 in\n9 in\nC\n10 in\n12 in\nSM\nLG\nA\n368 mm\n381 mm\nB\n190 mm\n228 mm\nC\n254 mm\n305 mm\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\nSM\n7.6 oz\n120 in³\nSM Hydration Bundle\n12.8 oz\n120 in³\nLG\n8.5 oz\n183 in³\nLG Hydration Bundle\n13.7 oz\n183 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\nSM\n215 g\n2.0 L\nSM Hydration Bundle\n363 g\n2.0 L\nLG\n241 g\n3 L\nLG Hydration Bundle\n388 g\n3 L\nMaterials: Fully recycled content Dimension Polyant RVX30 with C0 DWR. Recycled Polyester lining fabrics.\nReviews",
    "description": {
      "en": "This partial frame bag is ready for your next gravel adventure. With beefy zippers, stretch panels, a stiffened top panel, and full perimeter padding, the Sandur is durable, sturdy, and keeps its narrow profile to stay out of your way while pedaling. The slim left side pocket features organizer sleeves and a wire exit port. The main compartment is spacious with an extra mesh pocket for stashing small items. Our two sizes fit a wide range of gravel bikes.\nYou can purchase the Sandur either with or without our custom hydration system. The hydration system includes a custom Revelate X Hydrapak 1.5 liter water reservoir, Plug n’Play hose for easy refilling, and our Barnacle handlebar clips. \nDimensions",
      "ru": "Нарамная сумка Revelate Designs объёмом 2 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
