    "manufacturerDetails": "The Scrambler Pocket is our lightest, most race-ready front accessory pocket. It enhances roll-style cargo setups such as the Pronghorn or Hammerhead Harness.\nWith a roll-top closure and minimalist sewn construction, the Scrambler is at its best on long routes with plenty of vertical gain. Keep layers, food, and essentials within easy reach without compromising on weight or performance.\nDimensions\n\nUS \nMetric \nMax Height\n9 in\nWidth\n9.5 in\nDepth\n3 in\nMax Height\n229 mm\nWidth\n241 mm\nDepth\n76 mm\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\nOne Size\n4.8 oz\n213.6 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\nOne Size\n137 g\n3.5 L\nMaterials: Main fabric: Dimension Polyant UVX40, reinforced with Ultra 200. Made in the USA.\nReviews",
