    "sourceUrl": "https://revelatedesigns.com/product/shrew/",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-02",
    "manufacturerDetails": "The Shrew is our seat bag built for day rides. It’s a compact seat bag great for carrying spare layers and small essentials. It packs a mighty 2.25 L capacity and weighs just 5 ounces.\nMounting only to the saddle rails gives the Shrew maximum versatility and a near universal fit to any bike. Compatible with any seat post—dropper, suspension, aero, or high setback seat posts are no problem, the Shrew fits them all!\nScaled down from our larger seat bags, the shrew features independent rail straps adapted from our larger bikepacking seat bags with added hypalon wings that wrap the upper saddle rails. The attachment straps connect to a fiberglass stay stiffening the bottom of the bag for compression. This system gives the bag great stability in a small size perfect for daily adventure riding. A roll top opening provides fast and simple access to your gear, plus a rear stabilization strap keeps everything locked down tight.\nDimensions\n\nOne size fits most. It is mandatory to check tire clearance prior to use, especially with full suspension bikes or dropper seat posts. Bag contact with a tire can cause a bad wreck and ruin your day. Tire damage to the bag is not covered by warranty.\nMinimum tire clearance: 5.5 in from tire to seat rails\nUS \nMetric \nLength\n10 in\nLength (unrolled)\n12.5 in\nWidth\n5 in\nLength\n254 mm\nLength (unrolled)\n317 mm\nWidth\n127 mm\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\n5 oz\n137 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\n142 g\n2.25 L\nMaterials: Dimension Polyant VX-21 with abrasion resistant finish.\nReviews",
    "description": {
      "en": "The Shrew is our seat bag built for day rides. It’s a compact seat bag great for carrying spare layers and small essentials. It packs a mighty 2.25 L capacity and weighs just 5 ounces.\nMounting only to the saddle rails gives the Shrew maximum versatility and a near universal fit to any bike. Compatible with any seat post—dropper, suspension, aero, or high setback seat posts are no problem, the Shrew fits them all!\nScaled down from our larger seat bags, the shrew features independent rail straps adapted from our larger bikepacking seat bags with added hypalon wings that wrap the upper saddle rails. The attachment straps connect to a fiberglass stay stiffening the bottom of the bag for compression. This system gives the bag great stability in a small size perfect for daily adventure riding. A roll top opening provides fast and simple access to your gear, plus a rear stabilization strap keeps everything locked down tight.\nDimensions",
      "ru": "Подседельная сумка Revelate Designs объёмом 2.25 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
