    "sourceUrl": "https://revelatedesigns.com/product/speedbag/",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-02",
    "manufacturerDetails": "If you have a need for speed, then this is the bag for you! With the DNA of our award-winning Mountain Feedbag, we stripped away everything but the essentials, enabling you to carry fuel for the long ride ahead. \nThe Speedbag is a trimmed-down feedbag that is both smaller and 20% lighter than our Mountain Feedbag. The leaner shape and contoured bottom lessen the chance of leg contact when climbing. The bag uses a stiffened mounting panel with a single layer of UHMWPE-reinforced fabric to provide the bag structure. The main compartment fits a standard bike water bottle or loads of snacks, while the wrap-around stretch pocket is a stash space for wrappers \nSpeedbags are the ideal companion for your next light and fast mission or ultra race. \nMade in USA \nDimensions\n\nThe Speedbag can be mounted on the front or back of handlebars, depending on your setup and preference. Internal diameter max 3.5 inches (standard Nalgene bottle).\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\n3.32 oz\n61 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\n94 g\n1L L\nMaterials: Lid: 40d Ripstop\nPocket: challenge Ultra Stretch (4 way stretch with UHMWPE)\nBody fabric: Dimension Polyant UVX40 with Aramid x-ply\nReviews",
    "description": {
      "en": "If you have a need for speed, then this is the bag for you! With the DNA of our award-winning Mountain Feedbag, we stripped away everything but the essentials, enabling you to carry fuel for the long ride ahead. \nThe Speedbag is a trimmed-down feedbag that is both smaller and 20% lighter than our Mountain Feedbag. The leaner shape and contoured bottom lessen the chance of leg contact when climbing. The bag uses a stiffened mounting panel with a single layer of UHMWPE-reinforced fabric to provide the bag structure. The main compartment fits a standard bike water bottle or loads of snacks, while the wrap-around stretch pocket is a stash space for wrappers \nSpeedbags are the ideal companion for your next light and fast mission or ultra race. \nMade in USA \nDimensions",
      "ru": "Сумка на верхнюю трубу Revelate Designs объёмом 1 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
