    "manufacturerDetails": "Designed to be the only “Day Ride” Seat bag you’ll ever need. The waterproof Stoat securely carries your tools, tubes, and spares without any zippers or velcro to get gritty and gummed up.\nThe Stoat is the Shrew’s little brother. A single TPU strap snugs the bag in between the saddle rails and will not budge in rough terrain (similar to our indie rail style attachment). The interior of the bag is padded with high density foam to provide structure and prevent rattling of contents. The rear closure strap is TPU coated which easily cleans off road grit and mud.\nThe Stoat transforms into a stable on-frame storage bag that can be placed anywhere simply by reversing the direction of the attachment strap. It works exceptionally well on full suspension bikes, or as supplemental storage for a multi-day rig.\nThe Stoat is dropper post compatible – but always pre-check for tire clearance with your dropper and suspension at full travel.\nDimensions\n\nUS \nMetric \nA\n6.5 in\nA (unrolled)\n9 in\nB\n3.5 in\nA\n165 mm\nA (unrolled)\n229 mm\nB\n89 mm\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\n3.5 oz\n49 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\n88 g\n.8 L\nMaterials: Custom TPU laminated 400 denier ripstop Nylon, white interior; 1.0mm TPU Hypalon; High density closed cell foam.\nReviews",
    "description": {
      "en": "Designed to be the only “Day Ride” Seat bag you’ll ever need. The waterproof Stoat securely carries your tools, tubes, and spares without any zippers or velcro to get gritty and gummed up.\nThe Stoat is the Shrew’s little brother. A single TPU strap snugs the bag in between the saddle rails and will not budge in rough terrain (similar to our indie rail style attachment). The interior of the bag is padded with high density foam to provide structure and prevent rattling of contents. The rear closure strap is TPU coated which easily cleans off road grit and mud.\nThe Stoat transforms into a stable on-frame storage bag that can be placed anywhere simply by reversing the direction of the attachment strap. It works exceptionally well on full suspension bikes, or as supplemental storage for a multi-day rig.\nThe Stoat is dropper post compatible – but always pre-check for tire clearance with your dropper and suspension at full travel.\nDimensions",
      "ru": "Подседельная сумка Revelate Designs объёмом 0.8 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
