    "sourceUrl": "https://revelatedesigns.com/product/terrapin8l/",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-02",
    "manufacturerDetails": "The Terrapin® 8L is the smaller version of our flagship Terrapin® System 14L . The Terrapin 8L maintains all of the Terrapin’s best known features, including a mount that stays on the bike with a custom fitted dry bag for easy packing. With 8 liters of capacity, it is perfect for most lightweight bikepacking trips and fits bikes with low tire clearance. It is perfectly sized for small framed bikes, including plus bikes with inherently diminished clearance.\nThe Indie-Rail attachment system is a progression from conventional bikepacking bag mounts where the rail straps are fixed to the top center of the bag. With Indie-Rail, each saddle rail is cinched down hard to the sides of the bag, virtually eliminating side to side bag sway without the need for external hardware. We combine this with rigid internal structure and auto-cam buckles to prevent straps from slipping on rough terrain.\nThe mount is stiffened on all sides and includes an external plastic bottom sheet, which protects the bottom of the bag like a fender. A composite internal top sheet provides a solid and stable platform for the strap points and transmits the vertical load to the seatpost connection.\nWinner of the 2018 Bikepacking.com Gear of the Year Award !\nDimensions\n\nImportant information on use and fit: \nThis product is not designed for use with dropper seatposts.\nThis bag is for carrying soft, pliable objects. Sufficiently pad any hard edge objects like cookware to prevent premature wear.\nIt is mandatory to check tire clearance prior to use, especially with full suspension bikes. Always check for tire clearance with your suspension at full travel.\nBag contact with a tire can cause a bad wreck and ruin your day. Tire damage to the bag is not covered by warranty.\nPlease evaluate how your system works well before a planned trip.\nUS \nMetric \nMinimum tire clearance (A)\n7 in\nMinimum tire clearance (A)\n178 mm\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\nTerrapin® Holster\n13 oz\nDrybag\n4 oz\n488 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\nTerrapin® Holster\n369 g\nDrybag\n113 g\n8 L\nMaterials: Holster: Dimension Polyant VX 21 X-Pac with abrasion resistant finish; Rhinotec. Drybag: 200-denier waterproof TPU laminated nylon. Terrapin® made in USA with domestic and imported materials. Drybag imported.\nReviews",
    "description": {
      "en": "The Terrapin® 8L is the smaller version of our flagship Terrapin® System 14L . The Terrapin 8L maintains all of the Terrapin’s best known features, including a mount that stays on the bike with a custom fitted dry bag for easy packing. With 8 liters of capacity, it is perfect for most lightweight bikepacking trips and fits bikes with low tire clearance. It is perfectly sized for small framed bikes, including plus bikes with inherently diminished clearance.\nThe Indie-Rail attachment system is a progression from conventional bikepacking bag mounts where the rail straps are fixed to the top center of the bag. With Indie-Rail, each saddle rail is cinched down hard to the sides of the bag, virtually eliminating side to side bag sway without the need for external hardware. We combine this with rigid internal structure and auto-cam buckles to prevent straps from slipping on rough terrain.\nThe mount is stiffened on all sides and includes an external plastic bottom sheet, which protects the bottom of the bag like a fender. A composite internal top sheet provides a solid and stable platform for the strap points and transmits the vertical load to the seatpost connection.\nWinner of the 2018 Bi",
      "ru": "Подседельная сумка Revelate Designs объёмом 8 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
