    "sourceUrl": "https://revelatedesigns.com/product/ultra-shrew/",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-02",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Built for big rides across any terrain, from desert to snow, road to singletrack. The Ultra Shrew is a compact seat bag for carrying spare layers and small essentials. It offers 2.25 L of capacity, weighs under 5 ounces, and is made with high-performance, lightweight Challenge 200 Ultra fabric. \nMounting solely to the saddle rails, it offers maximum versatility. Dropper, suspension, aero, and high setback seatposts are all compatible, providing a near-universal fit across a wide range of setups. \nIndependent rail straps with hypalon wings wrap the saddle rails, connecting to a fiberglass stay for added structure and compression. A roll-top opening provides easy access without a zipper to get gummed up by mud and grime, and a rear stabilization strap prevents sagging. \nThe Ultra Shrew is a great choice when you need compact, stable storage in a lightweight and durable bag. \nDimensions\n\nOne size fits most. It is mandatory to check tire clearance prior to use, especially with full suspension bikes or dropper seat posts. Bag contact with a tire can cause a bad wreck and ruin your day. Tire damage to the bag is not covered by warranty. \nMinimum tire clearance: 5.5 in from tire to seat rails \nUS \nMetric \nLength\n10 in\nLength unrolled\n12.5 in\nWidth\n5 in\nMinimum tire clearance\n5.5 in\nLength\n254 mm\nLength unrolled\n317 mm\nWidth\n127 mm\nMinimum tire clearance\n140\nmm\nSpecifications\n\nUS \nMetric \nWeight (oz)\nVolume (in³)\n4.7 oz\n137 in³\nWeight (g)\nVolume (L)\n136 g\n2.25 L\nMaterials: Challenge Ultra 200 X UHMWP\nMade in USA\nReviews",
    "description": {
      "en": "Built for big rides across any terrain, from desert to snow, road to singletrack. The Ultra Shrew is a compact seat bag for carrying spare layers and small essentials. It offers 2.25 L of capacity, weighs under 5 ounces, and is made with high-performance, lightweight Challenge 200 Ultra fabric. \nMounting solely to the saddle rails, it offers maximum versatility. Dropper, suspension, aero, and high setback seatposts are all compatible, providing a near-universal fit across a wide range of setups. \nIndependent rail straps with hypalon wings wrap the saddle rails, connecting to a fiberglass stay for added structure and compression. A roll-top opening provides easy access without a zipper to get gummed up by mud and grime, and a rear stabilization strap prevents sagging. \nThe Ultra Shrew is a great choice when you need compact, stable storage in a lightweight and durable bag. \nDimensions",
      "ru": "Подседельная сумка Revelate Designs объёмом 2.25 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
