    "description": {
      "en": "The Big Node top tube bag is the longer and roomier version of its sister Node. Designed for ultra-distance competitions but also to be the reliable and safe travel companion for storing the objects you always need at hand.",
      "ru": "Сумка на верхнюю трубу Miss Grape объёмом 1.8 л. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
    "manufacturerDetails": "Introduction\nThe Big Node is the longer and more capacious version of its sister, the Node. Designed for ultra-distance competitions but also to be a reliable and safe travel companion for storing the items you always need close at hand.\nThe zipper is waterproof and opens in one direction.\nIdeal for storing cell phones, energy bars, snacks, batteries, cameras, etc.\nMade with our ultra-resistant , tear-proof and lightweight .\nThe bag has a capacity of 1.8 liters and weighs 186 g and is Water Resistant.\nThe interior of the bag features an adjustable divider that can be opened to create a single, solid and stable compartment.\nThe bag attaches to the top tube and stem and is compatible with all frame bags , thanks to the adjustable Velcro® strap . \nThe side structure is reinforced with a polypropylene frame to protect and keep the bag stable while pedaling.\nTo ensure the bag's stability, the base is made of a non-slip fabric .\nIt doesn't hinder pedaling , leaving the necessary space for the knees.\nReflective logo to improve safety while riding, even in low-visibility conditions.\nCharacteristics\nLength\n40cm\nHeight\n9cm\nLength\n4.5cm\nVOLUME\n1.8 litres\nWEIGHT\n186 g\nTechnical specifications\nDotted nylon 420 polyester 300 fabric with water-repellent polyurethane resin, 10,000 water columns, tear-proof and with very high mechanical resistance.\nPersonalized polypropylene tapes, black colour.\nNylon plastic accessories.\nThe Big Node Road bag is produced in Italy and certified according to the Reach CE regulation n. 1097/2006. 1097/2006. \nBig Node, the measurements.",
