    "manufacturerDetails": "Introduction\nThe Bud is mounted between the handlebars and stem using two Velcro ™ straps and then secured to the fork crown with a strap.\nVersatile and compatible with all commercially available bicycles. \nTechnical specifications\nDotted nylon 420 polyester 300 fabric with water-repellent polyurethane resin, 10,000 water columns.\nThe fabric is a black 210 nylon coated with phthalate-free PVC.\nNylon plastic accessories;\nThe Bud is made in Italy and certified according to Reach CE regulation n. 1097/2006.\nUsage tips\nThe Bud is the ideal bag for storing items you want to keep in an easily accessible place so you can retrieve them even while riding. Its diameter is designed to accommodate a water bottle or thermos, or a camera, supplements, keys, and so on. The Bud bag is made of weather-resistant fabric but is not waterproof. We recommend using a dry bag for items that need to stay absolutely dry.\nCharacteristics\ndiameter\n9cm\nheight\n15cm\nVOLUME\n1 litre\nWEIGHT\n88 g",
