    "description": {
      "en": "The Cluster 13 Waterproof saddle bag is a \"must-have\" for anyone undertaking a cycling trip. An essential item for any bikepacking experience. Whether you are leaving for a month-long trip or just one night, the Cluster 13 will prove to be an indispensable component for this type of experience.",
      "ru": "Подседельная сумка Miss Grape объёмом 13 л. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
    "manufacturerDetails": "Introduction\nThe Cluster 13 Waterproof saddle bag is a must-have for anyone embarking on a bike trip. An essential item for any bikepacking experience. Whether you're setting off on a month-long trip or just an overnight stay, the Cluster 13 WP will prove to be an indispensable component for this type of experience. The careful choice of materials makes the Cluster 13 WP extremely resistant to stress. It is precisely thanks to its tear-resistant fabric that this bag has become known and appreciated in the bikepacking world. Underneath, we find a reinforced double-layer fabric insert, thanks to which the Cluster 13 WP is resistant to any contact with the rear wheel and acts as a mudguard. The bag attaches to the seat post with two resistant Velcro straps coated internally with a non-slip material that guarantees excellent grip and reduces potential abrasion on the seat post by 50%. The Cluster 13 WP can also be mounted on carbon seat posts and saddles. \nTechnical specifications\nDotted nylon 420 polyester 300 fabric with water-repellent polyurethane resin, 10,000 water columns, tear-proof and with very high mechanical resistance.\nSmooth black fabric (wheel area) in polyester with double phthalate-free PVC coating, 30,000 water columns.\nCustomized polypropylene tapes, black/green and black colour.\nNylon plastic accessories.\nThe Cluster 13 WP is made in Italy and certified according to Reach CE regulation n. 1097/2006. 1097/2006.\nUsage tips\nThe Cluster 13 Waterproof is designed to hold everything you might need during a day on the bike. From rain gear, spare parts, a stove, gas, and camp food, to clothing and heavier gear.\nCharacteristics\nVOLUME\n13 litres\nMAX. LENGTH\n49cm\nHEIGHT\n14cm\nWEIGHT\n419 gr\nMAXIMUM CAPACITY\n5kg / 11lbs",
