    "manufacturerDetails": "Introduction\nFrame bag for racing, gravel and race bikes.\nStable, ultra light.\nDesigned not to get in the way of your legs (Q factor) and water bottles.\n100% Waterproof \nTechnical specifications\nDotted nylon 420 polyester 300 fabric with water-repellent polyurethane resin, 10,000 water columns, tear-proof and with very high mechanical resistance.\nCustomized polypropylene tapes, black/green and black colour.\nNylon plastic accessories.\nThe Internode 3 WP is made in Italy and certified according to Reach EC regulation no. 1097/2006. 1097/2006.\nUsage tips\nThe Internode 3 WP is designed to hold items you want to keep in an easily accessible place, so you can retrieve them even while riding. Ideal for sunglasses, vests, arm warmers, hats, gloves, multitools, inner tubes, pumps, and more.\nCharacteristics\nLength\n41cm\nHeight\n16cm\nMIN. width\n5cm\nMAX. width\n7cm\nVOLUME\n3 litres\nWEIGHT\n179 g\nDownload printable template",
