    "description": {
      "en": "The Node 2H (2 Holes) is housed on the horizontal tube of your frame. It has two holes in the underlying part and is mounted (screwed) only on frames that have two-bolt mounting holes on the top tube.",
      "ru": "Сумка на верхнюю трубу Miss Grape. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
    "manufacturerDetails": "Introduction\nThe Node 2H (2 Holes) Adventure is housed on the top tube of your frame.\nIt has two holes in the underlying part and is mounted (screwed) only on frames that have two-bolt mounting holes on the top tube.\nTechnical specifications\nAvailable in dotted black colour\nDotted nylon 420 polyester 300 fabric with water-repellent polyurethane resin, 10,000 water columns\nNylon plastic accessories\nRiri zipper model “Aquazip” M8 weather-resistant\nThe Node 2H Adventure is made in Italy and certified according to the Reach CE regulation n. 1097/2006\nUsage tips\nThe Node 2H Adventure is designed to hold items you want to keep in an easily accessible place, so you can retrieve them even while pedaling, such as energy bars, a smartphone, a power bank, a camera, and so on. The Node bag is made of weather-resistant fabric but is not waterproof. We recommend using a dry bag for items that need to stay completely dry.\nCharacteristics\nLENGTH\n25cm\nLENGTH\n7cm\nHEIGHT\n12cm\nWEIGHT\n125 g\nNot compatible with the MBC URS model.",
