    "description": {
      "en": "The Node 2H Road has two holes underneath and is mounted (screwed) only on frames that have two-bolt mounting holes on the top tube. Thanks to this attachment system, the Node 2H Road is particularly stable. This ensures that the bag clings to the top tube and avoids annoying sideways swinging while pedaling.",
      "ru": "Сумка на верхнюю трубу Miss Grape. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
    "manufacturerDetails": "Introduction\nThe Node 2H Road features two holes on the underside and is mounted (screwed) only on frames with two-bolt mounting holes on the top tube. Thanks to this attachment system, the Node 2H Road is particularly stable. This ensures the bag stays securely on the top tube and prevents annoying lateral rocking while pedaling.\nTechnical specifications\nDotted nylon 420 polyester 300 fabric with water-repellent polyurethane resin, 10,000 water columns, tear-proof and with very high mechanical resistance.\nCustomized polypropylene tapes, black/green and black colour.\nNylon plastic accessories.\nThe Node 2H Road is made in Italy and certified according to Reach CE regulation n. 1097/2006. 1097/2006.\nUsage tips\nThe Node 2H Road is designed to hold items you want to keep in an easily accessible place, so you can retrieve them even while riding, such as energy bars, a smartphone, a power bank, a camera, and so on. The Node bag is made of weather-resistant fabric but is not waterproof. We recommend using a dry bag for items that need to stay absolutely dry.\nCharacteristics\nLength\n20cm\nHeight\n8cm\nLength\n4.8cm\nWEIGHT\n98 g\nNot compatible with the MBC URS model.",
