    "manufacturerDetails": "Introduction\nThe ideal bag for the new “ILCOSO” handlebar mount . With its completely waterproof construction and two roll-lock entrances, the Trunk 8 bag gives you the peace of mind of knowing your items will be safe, no matter the weather.\nFeaturing a sturdy external structure and high-quality materials, the Trunk 8 bag is designed to resist wear and tear and last over time. Its sleek design blends seamlessly with your bike, while the large internal capacity lets you carry everything you need on your riding adventures. \nThe two entrances with roll closure guarantee a secure and waterproof closure, keeping your items dry and protected from humidity.\nDesigned to contain everything for the night. Sleeping bag, mattress, inflatable pillow, clothing, extra food, etc. \nTechnical specifications\nThe fabric is a black 210 nylon coated in phthalate-free PVC;\nAnti-tear with very high mechanical resistance;\nCustomized polypropylene straps, black/green and black colour;\nNylon plastic accessories;\nThe Trunk 8 WP is made in Italy and certified according to the Reach CE regulation 1097/2006.\nCharacteristics\nDIAMETER\n14cm\nMIN. WIDTH\n27cm\nMAX. WIDTH\n55cm\nMAX VOLUME \n8 litres\nWEIGHT\n129 g\nYou May Also Like\nILCOSO \n128.00 € \nAdd to Cart",
