    "sourceUrl": "https://cyclite.cc/en/products/food-pouch-02",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-04",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Description \nThe FOOD POUCH / 02 is a minimalist, all-purpose solution for quick access and transport right next to the stem. Whether it's snacks, water bottles, or clothing like gloves, arm warmers, etc., this small bag can hold everything you want to access quickly and easily while riding. The FOOD POUCH / 02 is also excellent for collecting trash. As is typical of CYCLITE, the bag's streamlined and well-designed construction sets new standards in terms of (ultra-light) weight, functionality, and stability. The bag can be attached to either side of the stem, allowing for the combination of two FOOD POUCHES for even more storage space. The FOOD POUCH / 02 is open at the top for easy and quick access, but its height prevents the contents from falling out. A mesh lining in the bottom keeps the bag clean and allows water to drain away. Due to its light weight (35 g) and great functionality, FOOD POUCH / 02 belongs in the basic equipment of every bikepacker.\nThe FOOD POUCH / 02 is ultralight, robust, and weatherproof thanks to our specially developed LiteGrid-RN200T3 material. We combine two different thicknesses of nylon using a special weaving technique to create a ripstop fabric, which is then coated on both sides and high-frequency welded. This results in the perfect symbiosis of lightness and stability – for weatherproof products that are easy to clean.\nCompatibility \nDie FOOD POUCH / 02 wird links und/oder rechts am Vorbau und Lenker geklettet. Dazu wird eine minimale Vorbaulänge von 60 mm benötigt. \nMaterial \nRecycled PA/N6.6 200D R/S TPU/PU3, Hypalon, HD-PE, mesh, reflective film \nTechnical Specifications \nVolume: 0.8 l\nHeight: 15 cm\nDiameter: 8 cm\nWeight: 35 g \nScope of Delivery \nBag\nRestraint straps\nFrame protection film\nInstruction booklet",
    "description": {
      "en": "FOOD POUCH / 02 is a CYCLITE handlebar bag in 0.8 L. Technical data is normalized from the official product page.",
      "ru": "Рулевая сумка CYCLITE объёмом 0.8 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
