    "sourceUrl": "https://cyclite.cc/en/products/fork-bag-01",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-04",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Description \nFORK BAG / 01 is a fork bag for bikepackers who need additional volume outside the frame without compromising aerodynamics. Its signature is the flat, wedge-shaped design, keeping it sleek and aero. Combined with a low center of gravity, handling remains balanced and natural. A stable internal structure prevents bulging, even when using the full 3.1‑liter capacity. A weatherproof zipper gives access to the main compartment, plus a mesh quick-access pocket for short stops on the go. The FORK BAG / 01 mounts via a quick, uncomplicated and reliable locking mechanism – either directly to existing fork mounts (threaded bosses) or, on rigid and suspension forks without mounts, via thru axles on the bike. For thru-axle mounting, an appropriate adapter solution such as the Old Man Mountain Axle Pack is required. Both mounting options are twist- and slip-resistant. FORK BAG / 01 can be purchased as a single bag for the right or left side, or as a set for both sides.\nThanks to our proprietary LiteGrid-RN200T3 material, FORK BAG / 01 is ultralight, robust and weatherproof. We combine two nylon yarn strengths using a special weaving technique into a ripstop fabric that is then coated on both sides and high-frequency welded. The result is the perfect balance of lightness and stability – for weatherproof products that are easy to clean.\nCompatibility \nThe FORK BAG / 01 fits all forks with at least two threaded bushings per fork leg, spaced at the standard 64 mm interval. Rigid and suspension forks without threaded bushings require an additional compatible mount, such as the Axle Pack from Old Man Mountain.\nFor optimal riding stability, we recommend using two FORK BAGS with balanced weight distribution. The maximum load per bag is 3 kg. \nMaterial \nRecycled PA/N6.6 200D R/S TPU/PU3, Hypalon, POM, PP, Elastic PA Mesh, weatherproof zippers, reflective film \nTechnical Specifications \nVolume: 3.1 l\nSize: 19 x 8 x 30 cm (L x W x H)\nWeight: 224 g \nScope of Delivery \nDelivery includes individual items \n1 pocket (left or right)\n2x fork adapter, 2x screw M5 x 12\nInstruction booklet\nScope of delivery set \n2 pockets (left and right)\n4x fork adapters, 4x M5 x 12 screws\nInstruction booklet",
    "description": {
      "en": "FORK BAG / 01 is a CYCLITE fork bag in 3.1 L. Technical data is normalized from the official product page.",
      "ru": "Сумка на вилку CYCLITE объёмом 3.1 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
