    "sourceUrl": "https://cyclite.cc/en/products/frame-bag-02",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-04",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Description \nThe FRAME BAG / 02 is our versatile, always-with-you bag that surprisingly holds a lot. It features two weatherproof zippers: one on the left provides access to a flat compartment, ideal for documents or money, while the other on the right leads to the spacious main compartment. Inside, you'll find two mesh pockets for small items and a key hook. A covered opening on the front allows you to route cables for powering a GPS, light, or mobile phone, or for a hydration tube. The FRAME BAG / 02 is best suited for carrying heavier gear that you'll need to access easily during the day (tools, power bank, lock, hydration bladder).\nThe FRAME BAG / 02 is ultra-lightweight, robust, and weatherproof thanks to our specially developed LiteGrid-RN200T3 material. We combine two different thicknesses of nylon using a special weaving technique to create a ripstop fabric, which is then coated on both sides and high-frequency welded. This results in the perfect symbiosis of lightness and stability – for weatherproof products that are easy to clean.\nCompatibility \nDie FRAME BAG / 02 benötigt einen gewissen Platz unterhalb des Oberrohrs, der bei einigen Mountainbikes aufgrund der Dämpferanordnung nicht vorhanden ist. Durch die Form der Tasche können Trinkflaschen im Flaschenhalter in der Regel verwendet werden. \nMaterial \nRecycled PA/N6.6 200D R/S TPU/PU3, Hypalon, POM, HD-PE, Elastic PA Mesh, weatherproof zippers, reflective film \nTechnical Specifications \nVolume: 2.8 l\nSize: 38 x 6 x 13 cm (L x W x H)\nWeight: 120 g (without reinforcement), 170 g (complete) \nScope of Delivery \nBag\nAlternative hook and loop fasteners\nFrame protection film\nInstruction booklet",
