    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-04",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Description \nThe FRAME BAG LARGE / 02 is the larger alternative to the FRAME BAG / 02. It offers 3.6 liters of storage capacity, providing more space for centrally and aerodynamically positioned gear (such as tools, a hydration bladder, power bank, and lock) that can be accessed throughout the day. The design ensures that even on smaller frame sizes, there's still room for a water bottle in the frame triangle alongside the FRAME BAG LARGE / 02. The bag is divided into two large compartments, top and bottom, and features an additional side pocket for credit cards, ID, or cash, two internal mesh pockets for small items, and a key hook. A covered opening on the front of the bag allows for the routing of power cables or a hydration tube. Despite its large volume and numerous features, the FRAME BAG LARGE / 02 is extremely lightweight, making it perfect for extended adventures or ultra-distance races.\nThe FRAME BAG LARGE / 02 is ultra-lightweight, robust, and weatherproof thanks to our specially developed LiteGrid-RN200T3 material. We combine two different thicknesses of nylon using a special weaving technique to create a ripstop fabric, which is then coated on both sides and high-frequency welded. This results in the perfect symbiosis of lightness and stability – for weatherproof products that are easy to clean.\nCompatibility \nDie FRAME BAG LARGE / 02 setzt einen gewissen Freiraum unterhalb des Oberrohrs voraus, der bei sehr kleinen Rahmen eventuell nicht gegeben ist. Der Abstand zwischen Steuerrohr und Sattelrohr muss zudem mindestens 44 cm betragen. \nMaterial \nRecycled PA/N6.6 200D R/S TPU/PU3, Hypalon, POM, HD-PE, Elastic PA Mesh, weatherproof zippers, reflective film \nTechnical Specifications \nVolume: 3.6 l\nSize: 44 x 6 x 22 cm (L x W x H)\nWeight: 214 g (without reinforcement), 282 g (complete) \nScope of Delivery \nBag\nAlternative hook and loop fasteners\nFrame protection film\nInstruction booklet",
