    "sourceUrl": "https://cyclite.cc/en/products/frame-bag-small-02",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-04",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Description \nThe FRAME BAG SMALL / 02 is our slimmest frame bag with a 1.4-liter capacity, suitable for almost any frame: as the main bag on smaller frames for longer tours or as a compact bag on larger bikes. Thanks to its slim design, it fits even on XS frames in the front triangle – as well as on full-suspension mountain bikes with shocks. It can also be used as a compact storage space between two large bottles. Like all FRAME BAG models, the Small version has two separate compartments: The larger zippered compartment on the right offers space for tools, energy bars, a light rain jacket, and a power bank. An integrated elastic inner pocket and a key hook keep things organized and secure. The narrow compartment on the left is ideal for maps, ID, or cash. The covered opening on the front allows for the routing of a charging cable for a mobile phone, GPS, and lights.\nThe FRAME BAG SMALL / 02 is ultra-lightweight, robust, and weatherproof thanks to our specially developed LiteGrid-RN200T3 material. We combine two different weights of nylon using a special weaving technique to create a ripstop fabric, which is then coated on both sides and high-frequency welded. This results in the perfect symbiosis of lightness and stability – for weatherproof products that are easy to clean.\nCompatibility \nDurch ihre kompakte Form passt die FRAME BAG SMALL / 02 auch in die meisten kleinen Rahmen und an viele Mountainbikes mit Dämpfer. In der Regel können auch Trinkflaschen im Flaschenhalter verwendet werden. \nMaterial \nRecycled PA/N6.6 200D R/S TPU/PU3, Hypalon, POM, HD-PE, Elastic PA Mesh, weatherproof zippers, reflective film \nTechnical Specifications \nVolume: 1.4 l\nSize: 23 x 6 x 11 cm (L x W x H)\nWeight: 84 g (without reinforcement), 114 g (complete) \nScope of Delivery \nBag\nAlternative hook and loop fasteners\nFrame protection film\nInstruction booklet",
