    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-04",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Description \nThe HANDLE BAR BAG NANO / 01 is the ideal handlebar bag for anyone needing extra storage without compromising their bike's aerodynamics. It offers ample space for a rain jacket, vest, extra food, or small tools. Its large, wraparound zipper allows for quick and easy access to the contents. Thanks to the innovative magnetic closure, the HANDLE BAR BAG NANO / 01 attaches effortlessly and securely to the handlebars and detaches just as quickly. It's very lightweight and stays firmly in place, even on demanding rides. Whether for gravel and road races or short one- or two-day trips, the HANDLE BAR BAG NANO / 01 is the perfect choice. With its minimalist, sleek design, it complements any bike perfectly, combining functionality with style.\nThe HANDLE BAR BAG NANO / 01 is ultra-lightweight, robust, and weatherproof thanks to our specially developed LiteGrid-RN200T3 material. We combine two different weights of nylon using a special weaving technique to create a ripstop fabric, which is then coated on both sides and high-frequency welded. This results in the perfect symbiosis of lightness and stability – for weatherproof products that are easy to clean.\nCompatibility \nHANDLE BAR BAG NANO / 01 lässt sich unter kompatiblen Aero-Cockpits oder Computer-Mounts mit GoPro-Aufnahme schrauben. Mit dem separat erhältlichen NANO HANDLE BAR MOUNT kann sie an allen Rundlenkern mit 31,8 mm Durchmesser befestigt werden.\nBei mehr als 300 Gramm Beladung, beiliegenden Sicherungsklett anbringen. \nMaterial \nRecycled PA/N6.6 200D R/S TPU/PU3, HD-PE, TPU, POM, weatherproof zipper,\nReflective film, PA12, Hypalon, neodymium magnet \nTechnical Specifications \nVolume: 1.3 l\nSize: 19,5 x 10 x 9,5 cm (L x W x D)\nWeight: 98 g \nScope of Delivery \nBag\nNANO UNIVERSAL MOUNT\nNANO COMPUTER MOUNT ADAPTER\nInstruction booklet",
