    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-04",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Description \nThe HANDLE BAR ROLL BAG / 02 is the ultralight option for attaching a lot of gear to your handlebars. Used alone or in combination with the HANDLE BAR AERO BAG, it significantly expands storage space and provides a good counterweight to the SADDLE BAG. The roll-top closure on both sides makes packing easy, and the included compression straps allow you to optionally tighten the ends against each other to ensure the brake levers aren't obstructed on drop bars. The integrated compression valve helps to pack the bag compactly. Additional gear can be secured under elastic straps on the front. Optionally, the included spacer foam can be attached to the bag to improve cable routing for external shift and brake cables. The HANDLE BAR ROLL BAG / 02 is particularly suitable for storing items you don't need immediate access to while riding, such as a tent, sleeping mat, or warm clothing.\nThe HANDLE BAR ROLL BAG / 02 is ultra-lightweight, robust, and weatherproof thanks to our specially developed LiteGrid-RN200T3 material. We combine two different weights of nylon using a special weaving technique to create a ripstop fabric, which is then coated on both sides and high-frequency welded. This results in the perfect combination of lightness and stability – for weatherproof products that are easy to clean.\nCompatibility \nHANDLE BAR ROLL BAG / 02 kann nur so breit genutzt werden, dass sie bei Drop Bar Lenkern zwischen die Griffe passt, ohne das Betätigen der Bremsen zu beeinträchtigen. Außerdem muss der Abstand zwischen (Ober-)Lenker und Reifen mindestens 21 cm betragen. Eine Nutzung mit Carbon Lenkern ist problemlos möglich. \nMaterial \nRecycled PA/N6.6 200D R/S TPU/PU3, Hypalon, POM, PP webbing, HD-PE, EVA, reflective film \nTechnical Specifications \nVolume: 12.6 l\nLength: 33 – 55 cm\nDiameter: 17 cm\nWeight: 284 g \nScope of Delivery \nBag\n2 pcs. 15 mm compression straps\n2 pcs. 10 mm short fixing straps\n2 pcs. 10 mm long fixing straps\nSpacer foam with hook and loop patch\nFrame protection film",
