    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-04",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Description \nThe SADDLE BAG NANO / 01 is perfect for carrying essential equipment such as a spare inner tube, compact pump, tools, and other important items that should be with you on every ride. Its innovative magnetic closure allows for quick and easy attachment and removal. It's very lightweight and sits aerodynamically behind the seatpost. The wraparound zipper provides quick and easy access to the contents. The SADDLE BAG NANO / 01 also boasts a stylish design that complements any bike – from gravel bikes to aero road bikes. The SADDLE BAG NANO / 01 is the ideal saddle bag for gravel and road races, as well as for all your training rides.\nThe SADDLE BAG NANO / 01 is ultralight, robust, and weatherproof thanks to our specially developed LiteGrid-RN200T3 material. We combine two different weights of nylon using a special weaving technique to create a ripstop fabric, which is then coated on both sides and high-frequency welded. This results in the perfect symbiosis of lightness and stability – for weatherproof products that are easy to clean.\nCompatibility \nThe SADDLE BAG NANO / 01 can be mounted on all common saddle posts, including profiled ones, using the NANO UNIVERSAL MOUNT and O-rings. It requires a seatpost extension of at least 18 cm. A rear light or radar unit can be attached using the separately available RADAR MOUNT. \nMaterial \nRecycled PA/N6.6 200D R/S TPU/PU3, Hypalon, HD-PE, TPU, POM, weatherproof zipper, reflective film, neodymium magnet \nTechnical Specifications \nVolume: 0.5 l\nSize: 18 x 5 x 9 cm (L x W x D)\nWeight: 64 g \nScope of Delivery \nBag\nNANO UNIVERSAL MOUNT\nFrame protection film\nInstruction booklet",
