    "sourceUrl": "https://cyclite.cc/en/products/top-tube-bag-03",
    "sourceCheckedAt": "2026-09-04",
    "manufacturerDetails": "Description \nThe TOP TUBE BAG / 03 is the next generation of our most popular bag. The large opening with a flap closure and magnetic fastener, offering easy access and a clear view of the contents, remains the central, unique feature of this version. The front strap design has been further developed: the hook and loop strap is now replaceable and extendable – making it compatible with integrated handlebars. As before, the bottom of the bag features light padding to securely transport smartphones or other electronics, even on rough rides. The reinforced sides and slightly reduced width of the bag prevent contact with the thighs, even during extremely sporty riding. Last but not least, the TOP TUBE BAG / 03 is bolt-on ready and can be screwed directly to the frame without the included hook and loop straps. This makes it the ideal solution for carrying snacks and gear that you want to access quickly while riding.\nTOP TUBE BAG / 03 is ultralight, robust, and weatherproof thanks to our specially developed LiteGrid-RN200T3 material. We combine two different thicknesses of nylon using a special weaving technique to create a ripstop fabric, which is then coated on both sides and high-frequency welded. This results in the perfect symbiosis of lightness and stability – for weatherproof products that are easy to clean.\nCompatibility \nTOP TUBE BAG / 03 passt an alle Fahrräder, die ein Oberrohr besitzen und kann hinter das Steuerrohr oder vor die Sattelstütze montiert werden (oder beides, wenn man zwei davon verwendet). Die Tasche kann optional auch aufs Oberrohr geschraubt werden, wenn der Rahmen dafür vorbereitet ist (Löcher vorhanden). Die Tasche bietet dabei zwei verschiedene Schraubpositionen, wodurch sie auf nahezu alle Rahmen passt. Der Mindestabstand zur Befestigung mit Schrauben, beträgt zwischen vorderer Gewindebohrung und Hinterkante des Steuerrohrs / Vorbaus 7 cm (bei senkrechtem Steuerrohr/Vorbau kann der Abstand noch etwas geringer sein). \nMaterial \nRecycled PPA/N6.6 200D R/S TPU/PU3, Hypalon, HD-PE, EVA, hook and loop magnetic buckle, reflective film, elastic PA mesh \nTechnical Specifications \nVolume: 1.1 l\nSize: 25 x 5 x 10 cm (L x W x H)\nWeight: 124 g (with hook and loop fastening), 138 g (bolt-on) \nScope of Delivery \nBag\nAlternative hook and loop fasteners\n2 screws M5x12 with O-rings\nFrame protection film\nInstruction booklet",
    "description": {
      "en": "TOP TUBE BAG / 03 is a CYCLITE top-tube bag in 1.1 L. Technical data is normalized from the official product page.",
      "ru": "Сумка на верхнюю трубу CYCLITE объёмом 1.1 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
