    "manufacturerDetails": "Description \nThe TOP TUBE BAG NANO / 01 is perfect for storing snacks like bars or gels. The central zipper allows quick access to the contents. The slim bag doesn't interfere with your knees, is aerodynamic, and sits very securely on the top tube. It can be attached and removed in seconds with an innovative magnetic closure. Its minimalist look perfectly complements any bike. Extremely lightweight and efficient, it's the ideal top tube bag for shorter gravel and road bike rides or races.\nThe TOP TUBE BAG NANO / 01 is ultra-lightweight, robust, and weatherproof thanks to our specially developed LiteGrid-RN200T3 material. We combine two different thicknesses of nylon using a special weaving technique to create a ripstop fabric, which is then coated on both sides and high-frequency welded. This results in the perfect symbiosis of lightness and stability – for weatherproof products that are easy to clean.\nCompatibility \nTOP TUBE BAG NANO / 01 lässt sich mit der NANO UNIVERSAL MOUNT und O-Ringen an allen gängigen Oberrohren befestigen. Mit dem separat erhältlichen NANO BOLT MOUNT kann sie direkt an Rädern mit Gewindebuchsen im Oberrohr montiert werden. Sie ist mit allen CYCLITE-Rahmentaschen kompatibel. \nMaterial \nRecycled PA/N6.6 200D R/S TPU/PU3, TPU, POM, Hypalon, HD-PE, weatherproof zipper, reflective film, neodymium magnet \nTechnical Specifications \nVolume: 0.6 l\nSize: 19.5 x 5 x 7 cm (L x W x D)\nWeight: 68 g \nScope of Delivery \nBag\nNANO UNIVERSAL MOUNT\nFrame protection film\nInstruction booklet",
    "description": {
      "en": "TOP TUBE BAG NANO / 01 is a CYCLITE top-tube bag in 0.6 L. Technical data is normalized from the official product page.",
      "ru": "Сумка на верхнюю трубу CYCLITE объёмом 0.6 L. Характеристики нормализованы по официальной карточке товара."
    },
