    "manufacturerDetails": "This larger version of our DynaPack® offers near TrunkBag space without needing a rack and features an expandable top to hold a helmet, shoes or other large objects. Molded from rigid EVA foam and 600 denier polyester for a sleek, aerodynamic shape, a divided main compartment, plus one zippered compartment handle organizational duties. The lightweight aluminum exo-frame features a quick release mount that attaches to seatposts measuring 24.5 - 34.9mm. Other features include a convenient carrying handle and 3M™ reflective strip and rear light clip for extra safety.\n\nCOMPARTMENT\nDivided main compartment, One zip pocket\n\nCAPACITY\n9.7 L\n\nMATERIAL\n600 denier (Extra water repellency & resistance to staining)\n\nBAG ATTACHMENT\nQR clamp (Fixer 7) Fits ø25.4 - ø34.9 round seatposts\n\nMAX LOAD CAPACITY\n4.5 kg\n\nINSULATION\nMolded EVA foam\n\nSIZE\n45 x 24 x 23.3 cm\n\nWEIGHT\n720 g\n\nADDED FEATURES\nExpandable top, Carrying handle, 3M™ reflective strip, Safety light clip \n* 3M™ is a registered trademark of 3M Company.",
