    "manufacturerDetails": "The smallest sibling in the MondoPack series is designed for smaller frame sizes or for cyclists who use a lower seatpost position. Two side opening panels provide easy access to all your gear and feature inner mesh pockets to keep items like keys and small tools in place while riding.\n\nBAG ATTACHMENT\nQuickClick® (F25) w/ seatpost strap\n\nCAPACITY\n1.2 L / 75 ci\n\nMATERIAL\n1200 denier polyester\n\nSEATPOST DIAMETER\nFits ø25.4 - ø34.9 mm\n\nADDED FEATURES\n3M™ reflective strip, Safety light clip\n\nSIZE\n24 x 12 x 11 cm / 9.4” x 4.7” x 4.3”\n\nWEIGHT\n200 g / 7.04 oz\n\nMINIMUM CLEARANCE\n18 cm (7.1”)",
